<h1>Methodology</h1>
<p>Reports separate four kinds of evidence: observed data, derived metrics, editorial indices, and context literature. Charts ship with a static image and an optional interactive view. Limits belong next to the claim.</p>
<p>The shared standard is also the <a href="/legal/ethics-statement">ethics statement</a>. Citations for each issue are on <a href="/sources">Sources</a>.</p>
